        "title": "Ninge tam dat mak pui ram",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ninge tam dat mak pui ram,",
            "Raguangh bam pui ram 7#@;",
            "Neimik keidat puni aniu hei ntam dat khang,",
            "Ai ninge tam mak pui Zion ram 7#@,",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai ninge tingkau munpuang ram;",
            "Immanuel ram 7#@,",
            "Poubaumei le ringmei thingbang,",
            "Sharon mun gai puang e.",
            "",
            "2. Tingkauh Jerusalem than",
            "Ringmei dui 7#@ luange,",
            "Mikrui hou makmei ramle ringmei thingbang khou,",
            "Salem kailuang lung khou jai gut lou o.",
            "",
            "3. Daihmei rang gaimei lung khou,",
            "Kau laujiu Nah nun bamme;",
            "Rianra jingmei guai le kapmei nai dat lak khe,",
            "Poubaumei rui jai gut louni khou 7#@.",
            "",
            "4. Daimei gaimei namdai lat,",
            "Sangam nituang ramme;",
            "Poubaumei le kau nthanmei nun bam puiram,",
            "Poubaumei bammei Zion ching gaimei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
